{"id":"rebelle","lemma":"rebelle","pos":"adj","rank":3162,"glosses":["rebellious"],"ipa":"/ʁə.bɛl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/73/Fr-rebelle.ogg/Fr-rebelle.ogg.mp3","forms":{"plural":"rebelles"},"formAudio":{"rebelles":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/04/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-rebelles.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je ne suis pas un rebelle.","en":"I'm no rebel.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Mon fils est un ado rebelle.","en":"My son is a rebellious teenager.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"son"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"teen, teenager"},null]},{"text":"Il avait appelé des traîtres, les rebelles.","en":"He had called the rebels traitors.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to call","l":"appeler"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"treacherous","l":"traître"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Les forces rebelles se préparèrent à combattre.","en":"Rebel forces prepared to fight.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"force","l":"force"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to prepare","l":"préparer"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to fight, to combat"}]},{"text":"Les rebelles ont pris le contrôle de la capitale.","en":"The rebels took control of the capital.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to take","l":"prendre"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"control"},null,null,{"g":"capital, capital city"}],"phrases":[[6,8,"of the"]]}]}